  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integral HIV/AIDS programme in Guadalajara, Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;	To provide integral support (psychological, legal and spiritual) to people living with HIV and AIDS and their families.
&quot;	To encourage people living with HIV and AIDS to have a greater sense of ownership about their fundamental rights.
&quot;	To raise awareness in society in general about the HIV and AIDS pandemic and to encourage a culture of inclusion and respect towards human rights of PLWHAs. 
&quot;	To develop strategies for the promotion and defense of human rights of PLWHAs, including advocacy work.
&quot;	To continue &quot;VIHAS de Vida&quot; institutional strengthening processes, with an emphasis in increasing the fundraising capability.</narrative>
  </description>
